{"4586570": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Where the City Ends", "steam_appid": 4586570, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is loud.<br>The crowds never end.<br>And somewhere along the way, you lost yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Where the City Ends</i>, you play as a character forced to question his everyday life after a life-changing moment. What begins as a simple journey home slowly turns into a passage through an overwhelming world — and a quiet struggle for energy, meaning, and inner balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the noise of the city, discover places of peace, and collect memories that gradually reveal your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every path leads forward.<br>Sometimes, it leads back to yourself.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The city is loud.<br>The crowds never end.<br>And somewhere along the way, you lost yourself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <i>Where the City Ends</i>, you play as a character forced to question his everyday life after a life-changing moment. What begins as a simple journey home slowly turns into a passage through an overwhelming world — and a quiet struggle for energy, meaning, and inner balance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Escape the noise of the city, discover places of peace, and collect memories that gradually reveal your story.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Not every path leads forward.<br>Sometimes, it leads back to yourself.</p>", "short_description": "A melancholic atmospheric game about energy management, introversion, and finding peace in an overwhelming modern city. Every decision costs energy. Nature helps you survive.", "supported_languages": "German<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4586570/405fa99d850a57d8882c7b43f682f84df72a6520/header.jpg?t=